---
/**
 * BasketKinshasaGame.astro
 * Expérience 3D pure et immersive : « Shoot à la Sirène — Terrain de la 7ᵉ Rue Limete, Kinshasa »
 * - Vue subjective à la 1ère personne (PAS DE JOUEUR VISIBLE, JUSTE LE BALLON DE BASKET DANS LES MAINS / EN L'AIR)
 * - Zéro glassmorphism : UI solide, broadcast TV, typographie percutante, contrastes nets
 * - Gestuelle tactile naturelle au doigt :
 *   * Swipe / glisser direct vers le panier pour doser et diriger le tir
 *   * Cloche parabolique réaliste (arc tendu ou haut avec backspin visible)
 *   * Jauge irréversible : ne jamais arriver au MAX (sinon tir raté sur l'arceau/panneau)
 * - Terrain urbain emblématique de Limete 7ᵉ Rue (Kinshasa) :
 *   * Bitume peint aux couleurs de la RDC (Bleu roi, raquette or & rouge, lignes blanches)
 *   * Panier FIBA détaillé : potence, panneau plexiglas avec carré de visée, arceau acier orange, filet tressé swish
 *   * Décor urbain : palmiers, immeubles de Kinshasa, panneaux partenaires (Equity BCDC, Sonas, Visa, Fonarev, Bloc Léopards)
 * - Physique réaliste du ballon de basket :
 *   * Trajectoire 3D exacte calculée selon le geste
 *   * Rebonds multiples, backspin en vol, collisions planche et arceau métallique
 *   * Détection swish pur avec animation physique du filet tressé
 * - Playlist musicale officielle en boucle (5 musiques dans /audio/jeu/ aléatoires / sélectionnables)
 * - Mode 5 tirs par série & progression de spots autour de l'arc (Lancer franc, Aile 45°, Tête de raquette, Corner, Logo)
 */
---

<div class="relative h-[100dvh] w-screen overflow-hidden bg-[#050914] font-body select-none" id="basket-root">
  <!-- CANVAS WEBGL 3D PLEIN ÉCRAN -->
  <canvas id="basket-canvas" class="block h-full w-full touch-none cursor-crosshair"></canvas>

  <!-- CANVAS 2D POUR LE TRACÉ TACTILE DE VISÉE (SWIPE TRAIL) -->
  <canvas id="swipe-canvas" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-10 h-full w-full"></canvas>

  <!-- ================= HUD BROADCAST COMPACT (100% SOLIDE, ZÉRO GLASSMORPHISME) ================= -->
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 z-20 flex items-start justify-between p-2.5 sm:p-4">
    
    <!-- GAUCHE : SCOREBUG KINSHASA & SÉRIE DE 5 TIRS -->
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
      <div class="pointer-events-auto flex items-center overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-2 border-[#1e3a6e] bg-[#060d1f] shadow-2xl">
        <!-- Logo Bloc Léopards -->
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 border-r border-[#1e3a6e]">
          <img src="/brand/logo.png" alt="Bloc Léopards" class="h-6 w-auto object-contain" />
        </div>
        <!-- Chrono 24s Shot Clock -->
        <div class="bg-[#b91c1c] px-2.5 py-1.5 text-center font-display text-xs font-black tracking-wider text-white border-r border-[#1e3a6e]">
          <span id="hud-shotclock">24.0</span>s
        </div>
        <!-- Score arcade : Paniers marqués & Objectif -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-[#071024]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <img src="/flags/cd.svg" alt="RDC" class="h-3.5 w-5 rounded-[2px] object-cover" onerror="this.style.display='none'" />
            <span class="font-display text-sm tracking-wider text-white">KIN</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1 rounded bg-[#030712] px-2.5 py-0.5 font-display text-base font-black tracking-wider text-or border border-[#1e3a6e]">
            <span id="hud-score-made">0</span>
            <span class="text-[0.6rem] font-sans font-bold text-slate-400">pts</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Objectif du niveau & Tirs tentés -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-l border-[#1e3a6e] bg-[#040917] px-3 py-1 text-[0.65rem] font-bold text-slate-300">
          <span>Obj : <strong id="hud-target-goals" class="text-emerald-400 font-display text-xs">4</strong></span>
          <span class="text-slate-600">|</span>
          <span>Tirs : <strong id="hud-shots-attempted" class="text-sky-300">0</strong></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bandeau Spot & Niveau -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 flex-wrap">
        <button
          type="button"
          id="btn-open-levels"
          class="pointer-events-auto flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-or bg-[#09142e] px-2.5 py-1 transition-all hover:bg-[#0c1b3a] active:scale-95 shadow-md"
        >
          <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-or animate-pulse"></span>
          <span id="hud-level-badge" class="font-display text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-wider text-or font-black">NIV. 1 · ÉCHAUFFEMENT LF</span>
        </button>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg border border-[#1e3a6e] bg-[#071024] px-2.5 py-1 text-[0.65rem] font-bold text-sky-300 shadow-md">
          <span>📍</span>
          <span id="hud-spot-label">Tir 1/5 · Lancer Franc (4.6m)</span>
        </div>

        <div id="hud-wind-badge" class="flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg border border-[#1e3a6e] bg-[#040917] px-2 py-1 text-[0.62rem] font-bold text-slate-300 shadow-md">
          <span>💨</span>
          <span id="hud-wind-val">Vent : 0 km/h</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CENTRE : TIMER DU NIVEAU IMMERSIF (CHRONO SOUS PRESSION) -->
    <div class="pointer-events-auto flex flex-col items-center">
      <div
        id="hud-level-timer-pill"
        class="flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-2xl border-2 border-emerald-500 bg-[#060d1f] px-3 sm:px-4 py-1 shadow-2xl transition-all"
      >
        <span class="text-xs">⏱️</span>
        <span class="text-[0.6rem] font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-300">TIMER NIVEAU :</span>
        <span id="hud-level-timer" class="font-display text-sm sm:text-base font-black tracking-wider text-white">32.0s</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-1 h-1.5 w-24 sm:w-36 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-[#040917] border border-[#1e3a6e]">
        <div id="hud-level-timer-bar" class="h-full w-full bg-emerald-400 transition-all duration-75"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- DROITE : BOUTONS DE COMMANDE (DÉFI + PAUSE + SON + MENU) -->
    <div class="pointer-events-auto flex items-center gap-1.5">
      <button
        type="button"
        id="btn-open-challenge-hud"
        class="flex h-9 items-center gap-1 rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/80 bg-emerald-950/80 px-2.5 text-[0.68rem] font-bold text-emerald-300 shadow-lg transition-all hover:bg-emerald-900 active:scale-95"
        title="Défier un ami en ligne"
      >
        <span>⚔️</span>
        <span class="hidden sm:inline">Défier</span>
      </button>

      <button
        type="button"
        id="btn-pause"
        class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-[#1e3a6e] bg-[#060d1f] text-xs font-bold text-white shadow-lg transition-all hover:bg-[#0c1b3a] active:scale-95"
        aria-label="Mettre en pause"
      >
        <span id="icon-pause">⏸</span>
      </button>

      <button
        type="button"
        id="btn-sound"
        class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-[#1e3a6e] bg-[#060d1f] text-sm text-white shadow-lg transition-all hover:bg-[#0c1b3a] active:scale-95"
        aria-label="Activer ou couper le son"
      >
        <span id="icon-sound">🔊</span>
      </button>

      <button
        type="button"
        id="btn-open-menu"
        class="flex h-9 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border-2 border-or bg-congo px-3 text-[0.7rem] font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-white shadow-lg transition-all hover:bg-congo-bright active:scale-95"
      >
        <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16" />
        </svg>
        <span>Menu</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ================= JAUGE DE TIR SOLIDE (DROITE) ================= -->
  <div id="power-meter-wrap" class="pointer-events-none absolute right-3.5 top-1/2 z-20 -translate-y-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-150">
    <span id="power-meter-zone-badge" class="rounded bg-[#040917] border border-[#1e3a6e] px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.55rem] font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-300 shadow">
      DOSAGE
    </span>
    <div class="relative h-56 w-5 overflow-hidden rounded-full border-2 border-[#1e3a6e] bg-[#030712] p-0.5 shadow-2xl">
      <!-- Zone Trop Forte (>= 92%) : Tir raté violent -->
      <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-[8%] bg-red-600/80 border-b border-red-400"></div>
      <!-- Zone Cible Dynamique (Réussite selon la distance et le niveau) -->
      <div id="power-meter-target-zone" class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-[60%] h-[20%] bg-emerald-500/85 border-y-2 border-emerald-300 transition-all duration-200"></div>
      <!-- Remplissage dynamique -->
      <div id="power-meter-fill" class="absolute inset-x-0.5 bottom-0.5 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-t from-sky-400 via-emerald-400 to-red-500" style="height: 0%"></div>
    </div>
    <span id="power-meter-pct" class="rounded bg-[#060d1f] border border-[#1e3a6e] px-2 py-0.5 font-display text-xs tracking-wider text-or shadow font-bold">
      0%
    </span>
  </div>

  <!-- ================= TOAST RÉSULTAT DU TIR ================= -->
  <div id="shot-toast" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-18 z-30 flex justify-center opacity-0 transition-all duration-200 -translate-y-4 px-3">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border-2 border-[#1e3a6e] bg-[#060d1f] px-5 py-2.5 shadow-2xl">
      <span id="toast-emoji" class="text-2xl">🏀</span>
      <div>
        <h3 id="toast-title" class="font-display text-lg sm:text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-or leading-none font-black">SWISH !</h3>
        <p id="toast-subtitle" class="mt-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300">Panier net sans toucher l'arceau</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ================= MODALE DE PAUSE (100% SOLIDE) ================= -->
  <div id="pause-modal" class="pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 z-40 hidden items-center justify-center bg-black/80 p-4">
    <div class="pointer-events-auto w-full max-w-xs overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border-2 border-[#1e3a6e] bg-[#060d1f] p-5 text-center shadow-2xl">
      <div class="mx-auto flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-white p-1.5 shadow">
        <img src="/brand/logo.png" alt="Bloc Léopards" class="h-full w-auto object-contain" />
      </div>
      <span class="mt-2.5 block text-[0.55rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-or">Temps Mort 7ᵉ Rue</span>
      <h2 class="mt-0.5 font-display text-2xl uppercase tracking-wide text-white">PAUSE BASKET</h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-300">
        Tirs réussis dans la série : <strong id="pause-streak-val" class="text-or">0/5</strong>
      </p>

      <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2">
        <button
          type="button"
          id="btn-pause-resume"
          class="w-full rounded-xl bg-or py-2.5 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-950 shadow-lg hover:bg-yellow-300 active:scale-95 transition-transform"
        >
          ▶ Reprendre le tir
        </button>
        <button
          type="button"
          id="btn-pause-challenge"
          class="w-full rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/80 bg-emerald-950/80 py-2.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-300 hover:bg-emerald-900 active:scale-95 transition-all"
        >
          ⚔️ Défier un ami sur ce niveau
        </button>
        <button
          type="button"
          id="btn-pause-restart"
          class="w-full rounded-xl border border-[#1e3a6e] bg-[#0c1b3a] py-2.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white hover:bg-[#162a52]"
        >
          🔄 Recommencer la série
        </button>
        <a
          href="/jeux/penalty"
          class="w-full rounded-xl border border-or/40 bg-congo py-2.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white hover:bg-congo-bright"
        >
          ⚽ Passer au Penalty & Coups Francs
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ================= ÉCRAN FIN DE SÉRIE (5 TIRS TERMINÉS) ================= -->
  <div id="gameover-modal" class="pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 z-40 hidden items-center justify-center bg-black/85 p-4">
    <div class="pointer-events-auto w-full max-w-sm overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border-2 border-or bg-[#060d1f] p-5 text-center shadow-2xl">
      <div class="mx-auto flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#0b2247] border border-sky-400 text-2xl">
        🏀
      </div>
      <span id="go-badge" class="mt-2.5 block text-[0.55rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-or">Séance de 5 Tirs Terminée</span>
      <h2 id="go-title" class="mt-0.5 font-display text-2xl uppercase tracking-wide text-white">SÉRIE TERMINÉE</h2>
      <p id="go-desc" class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-300">
        Résultat de ta séance sur le playground de la 7ᵉ Rue à Limete.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-[#1e3a6e] bg-[#040917] p-2.5">
        <div>
          <span class="block text-[0.55rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Paniers</span>
          <span id="go-stat-streak" class="font-display text-xl text-or">0/5</span>
        </div>
        <div class="border-x border-[#1e3a6e]">
          <span class="block text-[0.55rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Niveau</span>
          <span id="go-stat-level" class="font-display text-xl text-white">Niv. 1</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="block text-[0.55rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Record</span>
          <span id="go-stat-record" class="font-display text-xl text-emerald-400">0 🏆</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2">
        <button
          type="button"
          id="btn-go-next-level"
          class="hidden w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 via-or to-yellow-300 px-4 py-3 font-display text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-950 shadow-xl hover:brightness-110 active:scale-95 transition-all"
        >
          <span id="btn-go-next-label">Passer au Niveau Suivant</span>
          <span class="text-base">▶</span>
        </button>
        <div class="flex gap-2">
          <button
            type="button"
            id="btn-go-levels"
            class="rounded-xl border border-[#1e3a6e] bg-[#0c1b3a] px-3.5 py-2.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white hover:bg-[#162a52]"
          >
            🏆 Niveaux
          </button>
          <button
            type="button"
            id="btn-go-retry"
            class="flex-1 rounded-xl bg-or px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-950 shadow-lg hover:bg-yellow-300 active:scale-95 transition-transform"
          >
            🔄 Rejouer la série
          </button>
        </div>
        <button
          type="button"
          id="btn-go-challenge"
          class="w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/80 bg-emerald-950/80 px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-300 hover:bg-emerald-900 active:scale-95 transition-all shadow-md"
        >
          <span>⚔️</span>
          <span>Défier un ami sur cette série</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ================= MODALE DÉFIER UN AMI AU BASKET (100% SOLIDE) ================= -->
  <div id="challenge-modal-overlay" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden items-center justify-center bg-black/85 p-3 sm:p-5">
    <div class="relative flex max-h-[92dvh] w-full max-w-lg flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border-2 border-emerald-500 bg-[#060d1f] shadow-2xl">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#1e3a6e] bg-[#040917] px-5 py-3.5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <div class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/20 text-xl border border-emerald-500/50">
            ⚔️
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block text-[0.52rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-400">Streetball Multijoueur</span>
            <h2 class="font-display text-base sm:text-lg uppercase tracking-wider text-white leading-none">
              Défie un ami à Limete 7ᵉ Rue
            </h2>
          </div>
        </div>
        <button
          type="button"
          id="btn-close-challenge"
          class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-[#1e3a6e] bg-[#0c1b3a] text-slate-200 hover:text-white"
        >
          ✕
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-4 sm:p-6 space-y-4">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-emerald-500/40 bg-[#071d18] p-3.5">
          <span class="block text-[0.55rem] font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400">Règles du Défi</span>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-200 leading-relaxed">
            Partage ce lien avec un ami. Il affrontera exactement la même série sur le playground de Limete (mêmes spots, même chrono et même vent). Qui mettra le plus de paniers ?
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label for="challenge-player-name" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-300">
            1. Ton Prénom ou Pseudo de Shooteur
          </label>
          <input
            type="text"
            id="challenge-player-name"
            maxlength="20"
            placeholder="Ex : Dikembe, Jordan, Mutombo..."
            class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-[#1e3a6e] bg-[#040917] px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm text-white placeholder-slate-500 outline-none focus:border-emerald-400"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#1e3a6e] bg-[#040917] p-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
          <span class="block text-[0.55rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-or">Résumé du Défi</span>
          <p id="challenge-preview-text" class="mt-1 font-semibold text-white">
            Niveau 1 · Score : 0/5 paniers
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-300">
            2. Lien d'invitation à envoyer
          </label>
          <div class="mt-1.5 flex gap-2">
            <input
              type="text"
              id="challenge-share-url"
              readonly
              class="flex-1 rounded-xl border border-[#1e3a6e] bg-[#030712] px-3 py-2 text-xs text-slate-300 select-all outline-none"
            />
            <button
              type="button"
              id="btn-copy-challenge-link"
              class="rounded-xl border border-emerald-500 bg-emerald-600 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white hover:bg-emerald-500 active:scale-95 transition-all"
            >
              Copier
            </button>
          </div>
          <span id="challenge-copy-feedback" class="mt-1 hidden text-[0.68rem] font-bold text-emerald-400">
            ✓ Lien copié dans le presse-papier !
          </span>
        </div>

        <a
          id="btn-whatsapp-challenge"
          href="#"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-2xl bg-[#25D366] px-4 py-3 font-display text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-950 shadow-xl hover:brightness-105 active:scale-95 transition-all"
        >
          <span>💬 Envoyer le Défi sur WhatsApp</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ================= MODALE NIVEAUX (100% SOLIDE) ================= -->
  <div id="levels-modal-overlay" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden items-center justify-center bg-black/85 p-3 sm:p-6">
    <div class="relative flex max-h-[88dvh] w-full max-w-2xl flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border-2 border-or bg-[#060d1f] shadow-2xl">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#1e3a6e] px-5 py-3.5 bg-[#040917]">
        <div>
          <span class="text-[0.55rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-or">Streetball Kinshasa</span>
          <h2 class="font-display text-lg uppercase tracking-wider text-white leading-none">
            🏆 Niveaux & Spots (Limete 7ᵉ Rue)
          </h2>
        </div>
        <button
          type="button"
          id="btn-close-levels"
          class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-[#1e3a6e] bg-[#0c1b3a] text-slate-300 hover:text-white"
        >
          ✕
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-4 space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl border border-[#1e3a6e] bg-[#040917] px-3.5 py-2 text-xs text-slate-300">
          <span>Chaque niveau propose un défi chrono avec difficulté et distances accrues :</span>
          <span class="font-bold text-or">Record : <strong id="levels-best-streak">0</strong> paniers</span>
        </div>
        <div id="levels-grid" class="grid gap-2.5 sm:grid-cols-2"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center justify-end border-t border-[#1e3a6e] bg-[#040917] px-5 py-2.5">
        <button type="button" id="btn-resume-from-levels" class="rounded-xl bg-or px-4 py-2 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-950 hover:bg-yellow-300">
          Retour au terrain
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ================= MENU GÉNÉRAL & MUSIQUE (100% SOLIDE) ================= -->
  <div id="game-menu-overlay" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden items-center justify-center bg-black/85 p-3 sm:p-6">
    <div class="relative flex max-h-[88dvh] w-full max-w-2xl flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border-2 border-[#1e3a6e] bg-[#060d1f] shadow-2xl">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#1e3a6e] px-5 py-3.5 bg-[#040917]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
